    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c87d527ae3d6d8d2a912bc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Aug 2024 12:15:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi朋友们，好久没更新单口节目啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是时隔四个月，我终于录制了一期接近1小时的单口节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次想和大家聊聊上个月我和Julia的</span><strong><span>日本关西六日之旅</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>对我来说，2020年未能成行的毕业旅行始终是个遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span>积攒了四年的期待，所以这次旅行更像是和四年前的自己对话</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“年少时没能看到的风景，时过境迁后再去感受，会觉得遗憾吗？”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客是一时兴起的流水账记录</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望能够把当下最真实的感受与回忆分享给大家</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🏨本期播客里提到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>·大和Roynet酒店·京都</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoQhLMWJs7rEzYybDRCll_WvfEwF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>·SOUSOU·京都</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjFCZ5QPmE8izW4Q81XhBdNQWO2L.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;·野菜酒厂·京都</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrRURb3M_K7xn3sNR4Oec5Zdh89O.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·Yojiaya·京都</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGbEe5TQtA0AGEvicy6djD-1mMV.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·名代猪排·京都</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmYct7Kj0ZNOzhZC-9XbthkU8o5y.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·TN工厂店·京都</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi45USbzXEHF8lOJYmenQ0_cDKNC.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;·伊藤久右门·宇治</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpwZLH89q6NwGEXGkQoFj5Vp-OJv.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·Chiikawa·伏见稻荷</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpCMK4wBrbq2ldo3U47eg-xJEyYg.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;·北山洋食·京都</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlZx9LSPJr3PCcg2AF6pSvqG6GYK.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·小川咖啡·京都</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjPTfwHPaVDYOsEXiL6ZzMtoso--.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·下鸭神社·京都</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrsMG3rlvjKRtbbYiQeaMoNP7LxW.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·Dorajyu·大阪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtTpJXX9xaZ0uRYqrXdNCWJBRrng.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>·Amadeo·大阪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvQwuiUJJCGMan7kAmBxaOSyV4Sf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>·须磨·神户</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg8CxJEKbaFppVFkL7m9DVZLvSJd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>·通天阁·大阪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmmu82speAfG70DENFpZfO-B7rGJ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·Udon Kyutaro Osaka·大阪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fldo8-KQiP1mSQT0AEJCzG5Gjrzt.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>📮大家还可以通过以下方式来了解我：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5170263738" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5170263738"><span>微博：@MushroomNan</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a8968f911be1021b85be34b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a8968f911be1021b85be34b&amp;apptime=1686142651" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a8968f911be1021b85be34b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a8968f911be1021b85be34b&amp;apptime=1686142651"><span>小红书：@MushroomNan</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647c8c82db59230aa33c7648" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647c8c82db59230aa33c7648"><span>播客：依然自洽</span></a></p>]]></description>
