    <title>011 沟通困难者的自白：我不是不爱沟通，只是不想给别人“添麻烦”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6513c754a3b0404cbf4cede6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6513c754a3b0404cbf4cede6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Sep 2023 06:10:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一直以来，我都是一个沟通困难的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>沟通这件事情也始终困扰着我，给我带来了许多内耗和麻烦，本期节目是“沟通困难星人”的自我剖析，想和大家聊聊我为什么不爱沟通，我到底在怕什么，也想听听大家关于沟通的建议和想法。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⌚Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 我是i人，也是“社交悍匪”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 职场上的沟通困难表现在“不爱接打电话”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 不爱沟通是因为不想打扰，也不想被打扰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 很多成年后的困难，都在小时候埋下了种子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 感谢青春期的叛逆，让我远离了“讨好型人格”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔗相关播客：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>依然自洽：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650e64035c88d241269ca587" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650e64035c88d241269ca587"><span>016 看见隐匿的痛苦——盘点生活中的那些冷暴力、校园暴力和网络暴力</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f6ed3080c9ec4c5f3a8d3b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f6ed3080c9ec4c5f3a8d3b"><span>014 把同事当作NPC，将周末还给自己</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ad6740f4ccb12e0ba0c7ee" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ad6740f4ccb12e0ba0c7ee"><span>006 打工人发疯实录——到底是谁真正实现了“精神离职”啊！</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📮大家还可以通过以下方式来了解我：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5170263738" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5170263738"><span>微博：@MushroomNan</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a8968f911be1021b85be34b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a8968f911be1021b85be34b&amp;apptime=1686142651" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a8968f911be1021b85be34b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a8968f911be1021b85be34b&amp;apptime=1686142651"><span>小红书：@MushroomNan</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647c8c82db59230aa33c7648" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647c8c82db59230aa33c7648"><span>播客：依然自洽</span></a></p>]]></description>
