    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期节目邀请（胁迫）了“飞行嘉宾”萌哥，聊聊关于成长、压力和焦虑的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> “抗压能力差”是个伪命题吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 成年后的我依然走不出这样的圈套：怀念过去-厌恶当下-惧怕未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 为什么我总是在考虑事情最差的走向？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1996">33:16</a> 逃避现实的我，就像一只把头埋进沙子里的鸵鸟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> 人总会忽略自己已经有的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2624">43:44</a> 表面坚定的人，其实内心里也动摇过千万次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2861">47:41</a> 人生中的那些“套路”，或许是我们面对未来的铠甲</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📮大家还可以通过以下方式来了解我：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5170263738" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5170263738"><span>微博：@MushroomNan</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a8968f911be1021b85be34b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a8968f911be1021b85be34b&amp;apptime=1686142651" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a8968f911be1021b85be34b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a8968f911be1021b85be34b&amp;apptime=1686142651"><span>小红书：@MushroomNan</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647c8c82db59230aa33c7648" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647c8c82db59230aa33c7648"><span>播客：依然自洽</span></a></p>]]></description>
