  <item>
    <title>007 什么时候才能过上没有KPI的人生啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f3575d3fa4090b74f926c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f3575d3fa4090b74f926c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 02 Sep 2023 15:40:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一直以来都觉得自己是一个特别喜欢设定KPI的人，工作上这样就罢了，在生活里，也会给自己设定特别多的KPI。虽然这样会让生活更加有“目标感”，但好像随之而来的是无穷无尽的焦虑。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⌚Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> 怎么会有人生活上也要定KPI啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a> 充满KPI的生活与我可量化的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">08:13</a> 所谓的“浪费时间”，真的是无意义的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 放弃KPI之后的我，竟然减肥成功了？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> 贯穿我学生时代的KPI，真是让人又爱又恨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 有房有车就算完成人生目标了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📮大家还可以通过以下方式来了解我：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5170263738" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5170263738"><span>微博：@MushroomNan</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a8968f911be1021b85be34b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a8968f911be1021b85be34b&amp;apptime=1686142651" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a8968f911be1021b85be34b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a8968f911be1021b85be34b&amp;apptime=1686142651"><span>小红书：@MushroomNan</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647c8c82db59230aa33c7648" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647c8c82db59230aa33c7648"><span>播客：依然自洽</span></a></p>]]></description>
