    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e6e88180c9ec4c5f23f04a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Aug 2023 05:20:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>以前不太理解王小波的那句“爱自己是终身浪漫的开始”，一直以来，有些讨好型人格的我，始终沉溺于取悦他人这件事情上。</span></p><span></span><p><span>年近30岁，才开始懂得要如何去爱自己，或许真正实现“将精力放在自己身上”还需要走很远很远的路，但此刻仍然想与大家分享我的所思所想。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⌚Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a> 我爱人的方式，就是我希望被爱的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 对父母表达爱，依旧是十分困难的人生课题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 长大后的许多行为都是对童年时候自己的一种补偿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a> 像养女儿一样，把自己重新养一遍</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《海边的梦》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《東京タワー》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《自由が丘》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📮大家还可以通过以下方式来了解我：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5170263738" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5170263738"><span>微博：@MushroomNan</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a8968f911be1021b85be34b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a8968f911be1021b85be34b&amp;apptime=1686142651" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a8968f911be1021b85be34b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a8968f911be1021b85be34b&amp;apptime=1686142651"><span>小红书：@MushroomNan</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647c8c82db59230aa33c7648" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/647c8c82db59230aa33c7648"><span>播客：依然自洽</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔗相关节目：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64dcf6f080c9ec4c5f76891a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64dcf6f080c9ec4c5f76891a"><span>感情里的囚徒困境——藏不住的喜欢，说不出的爱</span></a></p>]]></description>
