  <item>
    <title>003 正式确诊为职场“大忽悠”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ddacb480c9ec4c5f80c2e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ddacb480c9ec4c5f80c2e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Aug 2023 05:14:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前几天和萌哥聊天时候，提到了自己工作这些年的心路历程，结合之前的自我复盘，和大家简单聊聊我对于工作的一些想法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⌚Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 只有拖延的上级，没有紧迫的DDL</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 真的会很烦下班后的工作消息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 甩锅的基层领导和背锅的下属</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a> 职场中的边界感需要自己建立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> 面对甲方，凡事留证据！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 只要我不想当领导，就没人能够领导我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 从职场“恶霸”到职场“大忽悠”的必经之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 代际之间看待“加班”的差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 我赚的哪是工资，是精神损失费吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗相关内容：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ad6740f4ccb12e0ba0c7ee" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ad6740f4ccb12e0ba0c7ee"><span>《依然自洽》006 打工人发疯实录——到底是谁真正实现了“精神离职”啊！</span></a></p>]]></description>
